      "hash": "0xc001a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f901234",
      "fid": 10004,
      "text": "Mira here. Shipping a small update to our L1 explorer: tx pages now show decoded revert reasons. Tiny change, most requested feature of the year.",
      "channel": "avalanche",
      "parent_hash": null,
      "minutes_ago": 9950,
      "embeds": ["https://build.avax.network/docs"]
    },
    {
      "hash": "0xc002a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f901234",
      "fid": 10001,
      "text": "Benchmarked three ways to batch transfers on C-Chain. A single contract looping over recipients won: 41% less gas than separate txs for 50 recipients.",
      "channel": "avax-builders",
      "parent_hash": null,
      "minutes_ago": 9870
    },
    {
      "hash": "0xc003a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f901234",
      "fid": 10008,
      "text": "$MOONX about to send. Last chance under a penny. Don't fade this.",
